{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-23","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：平面与角","englishTitle":"To construct a solid angle out of three plane angles two of which, taken together in any manner, are greater than the remaining one: thus the three angles must be less than four right angles.","book":11,"number":23,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.23","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.23/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":23,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","contentId":"euclid-11-23","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12561277fa11f8690bf24d51c74bf04aee7079bf239d670563fbe9734783ef39","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-23.statement","euclid-11-23.construction.1","euclid-11-23.construction.2","euclid-11-23.construction.3","euclid-11-23.proof.1","euclid-11-23.proof.2","euclid-11-23.proof.3","euclid-11-23.proof.4","euclid-11-23.proof.5","euclid-11-23.proof.6","euclid-11-23.proof.7","euclid-11-23.proof.8","euclid-11-23.proof.9","euclid-11-23.proof.10","euclid-11-23.proof.11","euclid-11-23.proof.12","euclid-11-23.proof.13","euclid-11-23.proof.14","euclid-11-23.proof.15","euclid-11-23.proof.16","euclid-11-23.proof.17","euclid-11-23.proof.18","euclid-11-23.proof.19","euclid-11-23.proof.20","euclid-11-23.construction.4","euclid-11-23.proof.21","euclid-11-23.proof.22","euclid-11-23.proof.23","euclid-11-23.proof.24","euclid-11-23.proof.25","euclid-11-23.proof.26","euclid-11-23.proof.27","euclid-11-23.proof.28","euclid-11-23.proof.29","euclid-11-23.proof.30","euclid-11-23.construction.5","euclid-11-23.proof.31","euclid-11-23.proof.32","euclid-11-23.proof.33","euclid-11-23.proof.34","euclid-11-23.proof.35","euclid-11-23.conclusion","euclid-11-23.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-23.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b77a56bfb408fdc62da8618c360850f0716ff00dbeae749f1ca61a4224bf07b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To construct a solid angle out of three plane angles two of which, taken together in any manner, are greater than the remaining one: thus the three angles must be less than four right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从三个平面角度中构建一个立体角度,其中两个角度以任何方式加在一起都大于其余一个角度:因此,三个角度必须小于四个直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f88c633c76e22698b6fa1394783c1d60df542a211279eb7b9745a01d3043248d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angles ABC, DEF, GHK be the three given plane angles, and let two of these, taken together in any manner, be greater than the remaining one, while, further, the three are less than four right angles; thus it is required to construct a solid angle out of angles equal to the angles ABC, DEF, GHK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC、DEF、GHK角为给定的3个平面角,让其中两个角度,以任何方式加在一起,大于其余的1个角度,而这三个角度小于4 直角;因此,需要从与ABC、DEF、GHK角相等的角度构建一个立体角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea6ac3f0b5763981f0d43aa54aeabb43cea6f66f68507f5a5b976d500d288ad5","citations":["euclid-11-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, BC, DE, EF, GH, HK be cut off equal to one another, and let AC, DF, GK be joined; it is therefore possible to construct a triangle out of straight lines equal to AC, DF, GK. [[XI. 22](/principles/euclid-11-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB, BC, DE, EF, GH, HK 相互等同, AC, DF, GK 连接; 因此, 有可能在直线上建造一个三角形, 等于 AC, DF, GK。 [[XI. 22](/principles/euclid-11-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7b611bd88760fdf3eca0f8cd1704457aacd1505f70975a7b66df92a3a6bb2e77","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let LMN be so constructed that AC is equal to LM, DF to MN, and further GK to NL, let the circle LMN be described about the triangle LMN, let its centre be taken, and let it be O; let LO, MO, NO be joined; I say that AB is greater than LO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"LMN建案,AC等于LM,DF至MN,GK至NL,LMN圆形图案,LMN三角形,LMN圆形图案,LMN三角形,LMN圆形图案,O圆形图案,O圆形图案,LOMONO连接,ABLO线,号圆形图超过LO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7cbea89053979cf1445053c181494a23e917d7b6963bf4bc040e1145edb15e1c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, AB is either equal to LO, or less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果不是,AB等于或少于LO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e94ab7b309c722009f81b1ccd1531daf2646ef5fdb7791f866fd8160108838a0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let it be equal."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让它平等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8842095af000396818abf6beceb7b62c383ff9ab1d5d8d818d2fa3150bd75a69","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AB is equal to LO, while AB is equal to BC, and OL to OM, the two sides AB, BC are equal to the two sides LO, OM respectively; and, by hypothesis, the base AC is equal to the base LM; therefore the angle ABC is equal to the angle LOM. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,由于AB等于LO,AB等于BC,OL等于OM,双方AB,BC等于LO,OM;假设底边,AC等于底边,LM,因此,角度ABC等于角度LOM。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9cc38909b3c90436400001ed89973cbfb078788542c1f885d7c21da871e603a3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angle DEF is also equal to the angle MON, and further the angle GHK to the angle NOL; therefore the three angles ABC, DEF, GHK are equal to the three angles LOM, MON, NOL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,DEF角也等于MON角,GHK角则等于NOL角;因此,334、DEF、GHK三个角等于LOM、MON、NOL角。（相关点与线段：ABC）"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8c121d653f7157cfeae1303ef59b682723ae8e466c221e502ca5a713a0496fda","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the three angles LOM, MON, NOL are equal to four right angles; therefore the angles ABC, DEF, GHK are equal to four right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但三个角度是LOM,MON,NOL等于4 直角;因此,角度ABC,DEF,GHK等于4 直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1108bfe05d0dc63a68578f05df608829874e6ff0ec4578fae5549ba265619e6f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But they are also, by hypothesis, less than four right angles: which is absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,假设说,它们也不到4 直角:这是荒谬的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"023f971fd64008a62b655a0a290bdac148bebf05fcd0adf96a1f7e09750b3694","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AB is not equal to LO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB不等于LO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df8a9b3367223c922e0594ad04b304466b2607c2e23daca79814cabd4411939a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that neither is AB less than LO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,两者中任何一个都低于LO。（相关点与线段：AB）"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89f3fed13eada404674eb527fa4d803352e7426e04db29f48873c4d4f32124fe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be so, and let OP be made equal to AB, and OQ equal to BC, and let PQ be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,就让它这样吧,让OP等于AB,OQ等于BC,让PQ连接起来。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1099f8e52c7be5a14ceabb9385d011e248e1580848fc91a1ad02337a0df6873c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AB is equal to BC, OP is also equal to OQ, so that the remainder LP is equal to QM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB等于BC,OP等于OQ,因此其余LP等于QM。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d10dffac92c5181e72217d25da4f06e673e4f5a3bed694c1cb04015aec0bd2f5","citations":["euclid-6-2","euclid-1-29","euclid-6-4","euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore LM is parallel to PQ, [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)] and LMO is equiangular with PQO; [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] therefore, as OL is to LM, so is OP to PQ; [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)] and alternately, as LO is to OP, so is LM to PQ. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,LM比PQ,LMO是PQO等方形;因此,OL比LM等于OP比PQ;而LO比OP则等于LM比PQ；OL 与 LM 之比等于 OP 与 PQ 之比；LO 与 OP 之比等于 LM 与 PQ 之比。 [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)] [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)] [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61f747672ecb302a49f0241733197bc35d2ba02ba40547248ba3f6a7a581ba00","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But LO is greater than OP; therefore LM is also greater than PQ."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但LO超过OP,因此LM也超过PQ。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ef0c713721662920cc7548b4e4cff6f35c16976103fbd9bbddd701312653597","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But LM was made equal to AC; therefore AC is also greater than PQ."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但LM项被定为AC项,因此AC项也大于PQ项。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d269828d597b81fd720587fa0e30b69c0ce8a90825dda55323bf50973a28df1a","citations":["euclid-1-25"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, the two sides AB, BC are equal to the two sides PO, OQ, and the base AC is greater than the base PQ, therefore the angle ABC is greater than the angle POQ. [[I. 25](/principles/euclid-1-25)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,双方AB、BC等值PO、OQ,底边、AC比底边、PQ大,因此,角度ABC大于角度POQ。 [[I. 25](/principles/euclid-1-25)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df1e3d12185b377548fa423173551f1484ba890767c919331094c51407a07b0a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that the angle DEF is also greater than the angle MON, and the angle GHK greater than the angle NOL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,DEF角也大于MON角,GHK角大于NOL角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb67a24819e6789c7e36766995264bba63cdf5a8751f0e3040968f3083e2ee08","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the three angles ABC, DEF, GHK are greater than the three angles LOM, MON, NOL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三个角度ABC,DEF,GHK大于三个角度LOM,MON,NOL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f9d08869eafdb8d23683598282989bf060f7328b286c9b2ef0d3adc85004c97","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, by hypothesis, the angles ABC, DEF, GHK are less than four right angles; therefore the angles LOM, MON, NOL are much less than four right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,假设说,ABC、DEF、GHK角度小于4 直角;因此,LOM、MON、NOL角度小于4 直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"48129009d4c5187b82d90219ea5bb69613225d0fedfb37507b05d350067c4c3e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But they are also equal to four right angles: which is absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它们也相当于4 直角: 这是荒谬的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed65e020c4be2dd0d9537fe6b68e51aac907e87a1734a00e5a83a46d3e119218","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AB is not less than LO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB不少于LO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6abcbd063af580c2820338da174bc9e30eb884f9ae44cb3eafe87128411d54af","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it was proved that neither is it equal; therefore AB is greater than LO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"事实证明,两者不相等,因此AB大于LO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":24,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61c1614be3b169f64b15392c3d663f15e53c21258a518a39c90ee863ab384511","citations":["euclid-11-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then OR be set up from the point O at right angles to the plane of the circle LMN, [[XI. 12](/principles/euclid-11-12)] and let the square on OR be equal to that area by which the square on AB is greater than the square on LO; [Lemma] let RL, RM, RN be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,从直角的O点到LMN的直角点,让OR的正方形等于LO的正方形比正方形的年大的区域;[引理]让RL,RM,RN连接。（相关点与线段：AB） [[XI. 12](/principles/euclid-11-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"101735d2e5e0a4e08f2f8f1939d0e6c34228eeba145d0fec89b1d5d91c971722","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since RO is at right angles to the plane of the circle LMN, therefore RO is also at right angles to each of the straight lines LO, MO, NO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"RO是LMN圈的直角到平面,因此RO也是LO、MO、NO等直线的直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ee4e9d014f4db167a25b64c7790c9ed18630a74149ae0f1d7de0d5015c886991","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since LO is equal to OM, while OR is common and at right angles, therefore the base RL is equal to the base RM. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"LO等于OM,OR是普通的,直角时,底边 RL等于底边 RM。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"564b09993a4bb72b2c9b8eee6e61c40acf72c6a09d9c529f20e7e277cbf20afb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason RN is also equal to each of the straight lines RL, RM; therefore the three straight lines RL, RM, RN are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,RN线也等于RL,RM线,因此,三条直线RL,RM,RN线是等同的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6fad4dfe5a78949367e826caaed6bf8b7604480077794b0bc5505a78ced78a2e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, since by hypothesis the square on OR is equal to that area by which the square on AB is greater than the square on LO, therefore the square on AB is equal to the squares on LO, OR."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,假设OR比正方形等于AB等于正方形等于LO,因此AB等于正方形等于LO,OR。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":29,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a2a2e9e647cfd4b0eadf28b405f667048340fff2dac8a3d001c53b5ae784c7b5","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on LR is equal to the squares on LO, OR, for the angle LOR is right; [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] therefore the square on AB is equal to the square on RL; therefore AB is equal to RL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是LR比正方形等于LO比正方形,OR,角度LOR是正确的;因此AB比正方形等于RL比正方形,因此AB等于RL。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.26","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":30,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 26","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a3db50c9c03124a0f0f71dada725396b49a725252284e76335286d75121658d6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But each of the straight lines BC, DE, EF, GH, HK is equal to AB, while each of the straight lines RM, RN is equal to RL; therefore each of the straight lines AB, BC, DE, EF, GH, HK is equal to each of the straight lines RL, RM, RN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BC、DE、EF、GH、HK直线各等于AB,RM、RN直线各等于RL;因此,AB、BC、DE、EF、GH、HK直线各等于RL直线各等于RM、RN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.27","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":31,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 27","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5cc8f37a0419314e3bb8c6741aa314bbbd366d4020bc04d38f716dae7c7e6094","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the two sides LR, RM are equal to the two sides AB, BC, and the base LM is by hypothesis equal to the base AC, therefore the angle LRM is equal to the angle ABC. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于双方LR,RM等于双方AB,BC,底边,LM等于底边,AC,因此,角度LRM等于角度ABC。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.28","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":32,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 28","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe31dde52cf0e3339728a80c62366ceb8278431754b32aa2adedcab08b284538","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angle MRN is also equal to the angle DEF, and the angle LRN to the angle GHK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,MRN角也等于DEF角,LRN角等于GHK角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.29","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":33,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 29","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf7f9cc5a93d860780cb3688caa4b007f8ed6803d28ec18168e780803ba3d7c8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, out of the three plane angles LRM, MRN, LRN, which are equal to the three given angles ABC, DEF, GHK, the solid angle at R has been constructed, which is contained by the angles LRM, MRN, LRN. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在相当于3个给定角ABC、DEF、GHK的3个平面角度中,LRM、MRN、LRN、LRN的立体角度已经建成,由LRM、MRN、LRN、E、F等角度组成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.30","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":34,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 30","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4aa6b2c3ce1d99eacf79bcd569858cdf22f8487811dfdba412f22102af130b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Lemma. But how it is possible to take the square on OR equal to that area by which the square on AB is greater than the square on LO, we can show as follows."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"引理,但如何能将OR的正方形 乘以AB的正方形乘以LO的正方形乘以这个区域,我们可以显示如下。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.construction.5","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":35,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9b08641169f3e50c9a934a3076752b9cb27d93f29120317fe1d4e57a13865e8d","citations":["euclid-4-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the straight lines AB, LO be set out, and let AB be the greater; let the semicircle ABC be described on AB, and into the semicircle ABC let AC be fitted equal to the straight line LO, not being greater than the diameter AB; [[IV. 1](/principles/euclid-4-1)] let CB be joined"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,LO直线排好,让AB大线排好;让ABC半圆圈排好AB,让ABC半圆圈排好ABC,让AC安装等于LO直线,不大于直径AB;让CB连接 [[IV. 1](/principles/euclid-4-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.31","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":36,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 31","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f35472ebd2d1d344c6321faab015656bbf019564e4b300db2942a38cfe41c902","citations":["euclid-3-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the angle ACB is an angle in the semicircle ACB, therefore the angle ACB is right. [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,ACB角是ACB半圆形的一个角,因此,ACB角是正确的。 [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.32","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":37,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 32","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"31d554f193a78a7bf857de93ef42ac5241f338c8fba2c02f472f875c2a570f95","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on AB is equal to the squares on AC, CB. [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB比正方形等于AC比CB。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.33","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":38,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 33","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dcd930fbb0deaf899c78a63390e34d695777078c23c3ce508b6cb10ba21837ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Hence the square on AB is greater than the square on AC by the square on CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB比正方形比AC比正方形比CB比正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.34","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":39,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 34","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"984c8cc50e07e4a8af0195796de2efa2b3a4b7e423790dbfa269344df0f37c20","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AC is equal to LO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AC等于LO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.proof.35","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":40,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 35","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"47c3c346f3ca28acaf091e5e6737cfec27f9f5431f1c5b93df0685688e58bf3b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on AB is greater than the square on LO by the square on CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB比正方形比LO比正方形比CB比正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":41,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"531e930628f189e6fd1bc21929675757e1db0389d55ec74597dbaf2e795990af","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If then we cut off OR equal to BC, the square on AB will be greater than the square on LO by the square on OR. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果我们切断OR等于BC,AB的正方形比OR的正方形还要多,OR比OR比Q比E、F。（相关点与线段：LO）"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-23.source","contentId":"euclid-11-23","revisionId":"euclid-11-23@raw-12561277fa11f869","order":42,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b8251a064a85efd48a631dcc31a87bc13fb0c5547c7534eb76f304eee9296c2d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.23/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.23\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-23:euclid-11-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-23","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-23.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.23","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.23/","sourceLabel":"XI. 22"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-2